{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00338",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 4.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Hi there, is it alright if I come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.01,
      "end_seconds": 10.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 12.42,
      "end_seconds": 15.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.49,
      "end_seconds": 19.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.32,
      "end_seconds": 23.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "So, I've been feeling very thirsty, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.68,
      "end_seconds": 29.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "When did you first notice it? Take your time, there's no rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.72,
      "end_seconds": 32.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.02,
      "end_seconds": 38.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 43.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.55,
      "end_seconds": 55.45,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "Yeah, I was getting to that! As for blurry vision, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.69,
      "end_seconds": 60.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Have you been feeling very thirsty at any time before this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.26,
      "end_seconds": 66.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "A bit, about six months ago. It settled by itself back then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.52,
      "end_seconds": 72.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss, abdominal pain or foot sores?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.5,
      "end_seconds": 84.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "No, no weight loss, no abdominal pain, no foot sores. I did have tingling in the feet at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.88,
      "end_seconds": 87.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Has there been any vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.43,
      "end_seconds": 90.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "No vomiting, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 90.97,
      "end_seconds": 95.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice vomiting. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.89,
      "end_seconds": 101.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.11,
      "end_seconds": 108.81,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. And chest pain, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.19,
      "end_seconds": 112.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "No chest pain, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.15,
      "end_seconds": 115.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.76,
      "end_seconds": 118.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Okay, so no problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.63,
      "end_seconds": 121.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.66,
      "end_seconds": 123.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 124.44,
      "end_seconds": 137.16,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Weight 74 kilos, pulse is 86 beats a minute, temperature 36.5, saturation 98 percent, blood pressure 163 over 103, height 177 centimetres, BMI works out to 23.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.63,
      "end_seconds": 139.52,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.25,
      "end_seconds": 143.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.01,
      "end_seconds": 144.71,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.92,
      "end_seconds": 164.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Okay, any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.14,
      "end_seconds": 167.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Yes, dust. I get itchy eyes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.78,
      "end_seconds": 183.89,
      "duration_seconds": 15.11,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.36,
      "end_seconds": 191.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.27,
      "end_seconds": 196.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 197.22,
      "end_seconds": 203.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "I've got high cholesterol. I've had high blood pressure, yes. I've had diabetes, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.81,
      "end_seconds": 217.33,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known high cholesterol. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. What about family history, any illnesses that run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.33,
      "end_seconds": 220.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "My mother has diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.77,
      "end_seconds": 224.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.61,
      "end_seconds": 232.23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a round yellow one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.81,
      "end_seconds": 235.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.14,
      "end_seconds": 246.37,
      "duration_seconds": 10.23,
      "text": "For my pressure, I believe. My husband sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given. I take glimepiride, 2 milligrams, maybe, before breakfast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.36,
      "end_seconds": 250.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Have you got the box or the prescription on you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.93,
      "end_seconds": 254.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.15,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.23,
      "end_seconds": 270.03,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.15,
      "end_seconds": 272.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.38,
      "end_seconds": 276.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, let's do a quick examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.09,
      "end_seconds": 277.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.98,
      "end_seconds": 281.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.76,
      "end_seconds": 295.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Your feet look fine, no ulcers or sores, and the pulses are palpable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.98,
      "end_seconds": 298.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.86,
      "end_seconds": 310.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Sensation to the monofilament is reduced on the right foot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.55,
      "end_seconds": 325.15,
      "duration_seconds": 12.6,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. So, based on the history and the examination, it fits best with diabetes that isn't well controlled. It could also be a medication issue, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.4,
      "end_seconds": 328.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 329.8,
      "end_seconds": 344.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with diabetes that isn't well controlled do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've been feeling very thirsty for two months, and no abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.5,
      "end_seconds": 345.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.96,
      "end_seconds": 361.25,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "I'm going to order an eye check, for diabetes. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's get a urine protein test, for diabetes. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.03,
      "end_seconds": 363.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.86,
      "end_seconds": 367.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.34,
      "end_seconds": 375.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.21,
      "text": "I had an HbA1c done at another clinic a few months ago. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.53,
      "end_seconds": 396.45,
      "duration_seconds": 19.92,
      "text": "Check your feet every day, and never walk barefoot. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. I'll also refer you to a dietitian."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 401.11,
      "end_seconds": 402.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.65,
      "end_seconds": 410.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.85,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.82,
      "end_seconds": 413.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.35,
      "end_seconds": 421.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Please don't sit on it if you vomit repeatedly or become drowsy. That's the point to get seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.68,
      "end_seconds": 423.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 424.1,
      "end_seconds": 427.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 431.27,
      "end_seconds": 433.16,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 433.92,
      "end_seconds": 438.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 439.32,
      "end_seconds": 443.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 444.06,
      "end_seconds": 448.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0070",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 453.67,
      "end_seconds": 458.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.54,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    }
  ]
}